{"id":"n85140-1-9","stage":5,"title":"해군 · 海军","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85140-1-9-1","ko":"승규가 다음 달에 입대하지? 어디로 가기로 했대?","zh":"承奎下个月要入伍吧？听说他决定去哪儿了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次。","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}},{"text":"달에","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달에","audio":"/audio/0f8e45b47a9b54bf0acc.mp3"}},{"text":"입대하지?","meaning":"入伍，参军","explanation":"입대하다：入伍，参军；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"입대하다","audio":"/audio/00b0f3000df28b307785.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73060","senseId":"1","lemma":"입대하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입대하지","audio":"/audio/062062aad98858c2a350.mp3"}},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디로","audio":"/audio/0fbbfd5af1ab3c98e173.mp3"}},{"text":"가기로","meaning":"上，进","explanation":"가다：上，进；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"8","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary